%% `Task: score: actors`; score 1 painful → 5 delighted, so low scores mark where to look.
%% One section per stage of the journey; list every actor that takes part in the task.
%% A body `title …` line is the alternative to frontmatter `title`.
journey
  section Discover
    Search for a gift: 4: Customer
    Compare prices: 3: Customer
  section Buy
    Add to cart: 5: Customer
    Enter card details: 2: Customer, Payment provider
    Get confirmation: 4: Customer, Store
  section After purchase
    Track delivery: 3: Customer, Courier
    Return the item: 1: Customer, Support
